# Build contexts are the REPOSITORY ROOT (D152), so that images can COPY from
# shared libs/. Without this file every `docker compose build` ships the whole
# ~940 MB tree to the daemon — mjolnir/base alone is 460 MB and smia/providers
# 373 MB, and neither is COPYed by any Dockerfile.
#
# Derived from the actual COPY lines of all six Dockerfiles, not from a guess.
# Before adding an entry here, check it is not COPYed:
#   grep -nE '^(COPY|ADD)' */Dockerfile */*/Dockerfile
#
# DO NOT add phonexa/lang — phonexa/Dockerfile:32 copies it into the image.

.git
.gitignore
.claude

# --- never needed in any image -------------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# --- documentation and planning (no Dockerfile reads these) ---------------
docs
openspec
*.md
**/*.md
tun.code-workspace

# --- mjolnir: hub/builder COPY only package.json + lockfiles; the source
#     arrives at runtime through the `.:/app` bind mount, so the build context
#     needs none of the rest.
mjolnir/base
mjolnir/apk
mjolnir/data
mjolnir/diff-output
mjolnir/index.android.bundle*
mjolnir/patches
mjolnir/test
mjolnir/bundle-tool.iml
mjolnir/caddy

# --- smia: providers/ is a RUNTIME BIND MOUNT (./providers:/app/providers:ro),
#     never copied. 373 MB of raw provider dumps.
smia/providers

# --- stabbur: blobs are a named volume, not image content.
stabbur/blobs
stabbur/cookies.txt

# --- phonexa: these are volumes / exports, not image content.
#     NOTE phonexa/lang IS copied (Dockerfile:32) and must NOT be listed.
phonexa/backups
phonexa/data
phonexa/db-export
phonexa/sounds

# --- hover-translate is a browser extension; nothing builds an image from it.
hover-translate

# --- the git-backup clone the operator happens to keep inside the checkout.
tun-backup

# --- archives and binaries -------------------------------------------------
*.apk
*.zip
*.crx
*.pem
*.log
.env
**/.env
